public class ServletRequestAttributes extends AbstractRequestAttributes &#123;	/**	 * Create a new ServletRequestAttributes instance for the given request.	 * @param request current HTTP request	 */	public ServletRequestAttributes(HttpServletRequest request) &#123;		Assert.notNull(request, &quot;Request must not be null&quot;);		this.request = request;	&#125;&#125;
在 RequestContextFilter 的子类 OrderedRequestContextFilter：
@Override	protected void doFilterInternal(			HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response, FilterChain filterChain)			throws ServletException, IOException &#123;		ServletRequestAttributes attributes = new ServletRequestAttributes(request, response);		// 在这一步放入 threadlocal		initContextHolders(request, attributes);		try &#123;			filterChain.doFilter(request, response);		&#125;		finally &#123;			resetContextHolders();			if (logger.isTraceEnabled()) &#123;				logger.trace(&quot;Cleared thread-bound request context: &quot; + request);			&#125;			attributes.requestCompleted();		&#125;	&#125;
每个请求都可以拦截的过滤器
Spring 大量使用 OncePerRequestFilter。常见的 Filter 链有：WebMvcMetricFilter、OrderedContentFilter、DelegatingFilterProxyRegistrationBean。
在上层是 tomcat 的 filter 链，下层才到 dispachServlet。
